  "summary": "Malicious code in @hzero-front-ui/cfg (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall and install hooks run on installation: they base64-encode the current username, hostname, and working directory and send them to hxxps://\u003cpackage-name\u003e.callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk/\u003cbase64-payload\u003e via an HTTP GET, and also exfiltrate the package name via a DNS nslookup query to \u003cbase64-package-name\u003e.\u003cpackage-name\u003e.callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk. This is a covert host-metadata beacon that reports the victim's identity and environment to the attacker-controlled domain m0chan[.]co[.]uk on every install.",
